# The wreckers' land way under Jory's Crown on Wreckers' Cove (CIPlay wreckers_cove_vines, 11-12 w15 prep). In a test world
# NOT named 'CI ...' (vines are cut only outside CI worlds, as in hookline_stack_caves). Points as in the recipe: kit_dig
# mouth on a shelf at -52 9.5 (7.04 m, the Crown's foot ring; way in = +z), 3 m level, 10 m on (to z 22.5), the room to
# z 27.5; the vines (wcvine_vines) across the mouth; the stakes (wcspike) and the hazard zone wcspikes at -52 17 (r 2,
# pulse 2 s up / 3 s down, safe=none); the lever wclever at -53 26.5; the strongbox wcbox at -50.5 25 (talked-gated by
# Wrecker Elaine at -6.5 -3.5) over the hidden chest wcvinechest. Floors 7.04 (the shelf; the slope round it a guess).
# Offline-written, never run.
# The machete first: Thornwood's temple offering (a start island of this world)
island Thornwood
open Temple offering
wait 3
expect item Machete 1

island Wreckers' Cove
hour 11
weather Calm
where ChoppableVines

# The vines across the mouth: blocked, cut, then in
expect hidden wcvinesign
picture wc_vine_out -52 +3 2 -52 +1.5 9.5
walk -52 4 to -52 9.5 to -52 14 blocked
expect shown wcvine_vines
use wcvine_vines
expect hidden wcvine_vines

# Onto the stakes: hurt and the message
expect shown wcspikes
expect shown wcspike
walk -52 4 to -52 9.5 to -52 13 to -52 17
wait 7
expect message wreckers' trap
expect hurt 4
picture wc_spikes -52 +2 12.5 -52 +0 17 light=20

# On into the room: the lever stops the stakes; the strongbox is letter-locked (nobody talked to Elaine)
walk -52 17 to -52 20 to -52 24 to -52.5 25.5
zone wc_crowncellar
use wclever
expect hidden wcspikes
expect hidden wcspike
use wcbox
expect message letter lock
expect hidden wcvinechest
picture wc_cellar_in -52 +2.5 20 -52 +0.5 26 light=20

# Back out over the dead stakes: unhurt
walk -52.5 25.5 to -52 24 to -52 17 to -52 13 to -52 9.5 to -52 4
wait 5
expect unhurt

# Elaine at the jetty's head: her second answer names the strongbox's word
at -8 -7
use Wrecker Elaine pick 2
expect message Mind the stakes
expect shown wcvinesign

# Back to the cellar: the strongbox opens on the chest
at -52 4
walk -52 4 to -52 9.5 to -52 17 to -52 24 to -51.5 25
use wcbox
expect message hasp springs open
expect hidden wcbox
expect shown wcvinechest
open Wreckers' strongbox
wait 2
expect item Battery 1
walk -51.5 25 to -52 24 to -52 9.5 to -52 4
